      "note": "False positive (host Odoo #5884). The class name is always prefixed with Endpoints:: and ActiveSupport's constantize never falls back to a top-level constant (Endpoints::String raises NameError), so only an existing Endpoints::* class can be loaded; nothing is instantiated here. Guarded by the host's test/integration/api_reflection_test.rb."
